.apng?t=1753489536\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=125 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80<strong>- Intricately drawn pixel art cast:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game takes place entirely in a pixel aesthetic with a pixel art cast, environments and UI!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80<strong>- Ground breaking AI Conversation System: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new approach to AI in video games. Converse with the cast like never before. With an AI trained by real actors portraying the cast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80<strong>- Manage relationships: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you say matters. With realistic conversations the cast feel the full range of emotions. You can upset them, make them jealous and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80<strong>- And battle through rumours: </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware, rumours can spread through Escafeld College quickly! The cast can spread rumours about you, and they could be good or bad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80<strong>- RPG Stat System: </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you spend your free time, and build your stats. These will shape the experience you have at Escafeld College!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80<strong>- Completely Offline: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other AI games that require you to be online, Millennium Whisper is entirely offline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf80<strong>-  13 Character Cast: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with their own look, personality, interests, and more. They won\u2019t make it easy for you, and you\u2019ll quickly find yourself immersed in the challenge of trying to Rizz-Em-Up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156240/extras/f51fd62da1f6530fae3c7b56a9a98c3a.poster.avif?t=1753489536\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156240/extras/f51fd62da1f6530fae3c7b56a9a98c3a.apng?t=1753489536\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=125 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156240/extras/45956122ab6beff4e479d9d7998a6653.avif?t=1753489536\" width=756 height=1514 /></span></p>",
